; http — an HTTP/1.1 server over scaly.os.Tcp.
;
; ROADMAP-http.md, stage A: the milestone towards the FHIR server, measured
; against the fastest frameworks on HttpArena's harness. The modules, in
; dependency order: byte-level helpers, the growable buffer, the request and
; its parser, the Date field, the response writer, the router and the
; connection loop.

package scaly 0.1.0

define http
{
    module Text
    module Buffer
    module Request
    module Date
    module Response
    module Server
}
